---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Villa Paris" description="Privacy policy of Villa Paris, wedding and event venue in Roseto degli Abruzzi." locale="en">
  <section class="section-padding bg-dotted pt-40">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
      <div class="line-accent mb-6"></div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light tracking-wide mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none text-muted-foreground font-body leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p><strong>1. Data Controller</strong><br/>Villa Paris, Via Acquaviva, 11 - 64026 Roseto degli Abruzzi (TE), Italy<br/>Email: info@villaparis.it</p>
        <p><strong>2. Data Collected</strong><br/>We collect personal data you voluntarily provide through the contact form: name, email, phone, event type, event date, and message.</p>
        <p><strong>3. Purpose of Processing</strong><br/>Your data is used exclusively to respond to your requests for information and quotes regarding our services.</p>
        <p><strong>4. Legal Basis</strong><br/>Processing is based on your explicit consent (Art. 6 para. 1 lit. a GDPR) and pre-contractual measures (Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b GDPR).</p>
        <p><strong>5. Data Retention</strong><br/>Data will be retained for the time necessary to fulfill your request and no longer than 24 months.</p>
        <p><strong>6. Your Rights</strong><br/>You may exercise your rights (access, rectification, erasure, restriction, portability, objection) by writing to info@villaparis.it.</p>
        <p><strong>7. Cookies and external services</strong><br/>This site uses essential technical cookies and embeds a Google Maps map on the contacts page. Interacting with the map may load resources and cookies managed by Google according to its own policies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
